<Base
  title="Token Diff · Specsure"
  description="Compare two versions of design tokens: what changed, what breaks and which semver bump it needs. DTCG, CSS custom properties, npm packages and GitHub. Runs in your browser."
  path="/tools/diff"
>
  <header class="page-head">
